{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "tool_result", "content": "Exit code 1\nPaper 2509.13989 not found\n===\n# DMP-TTS: Disentangled multi-modal Prompting for Controllable Text-to-Speech with Chained Guidance\narXiv: 2512.09504\nAuthors: Kang Yin, Chunyu Qiang, Sirui Zhao, Xiaopeng Wang, Yuzhe Liang, Pengfei Cai, Tong Xu, Chen Zhang, Enhong Chen\nYear: 2025 | Venue: \nTopic: tts_vc\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. We propose DMP-TTS, a DiT-based TTS framework that supports multi-modal prompting and achieves explicit style–timbre disentanglement.\n  2. We build Style-CLAP, a cross-modal encoder that learns a shared, discriminative space for style attributes by aligning audio and descriptive text via contrastive learning and multi-task supervision.\n  3. We introduce cCFG, a chained classifier-free guidance scheme that enables independent, continuous control of content, timbre, and style, and adopt representation alignment (REPA) to stabilize and accelerate training.\n\nTags: TTS, TTS/架构-NAR-Diffusion, TTS/功能-DiT, TTS/控制-风格标签, TTS/控制-NL描述, TTS/控制-参考语音\n===\nPaper 2601.12480 not found", "is_error": true, "tool_use_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9706e6c8861b1260"}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "ae723d2c-4305-4e55-ac39-56b81999577a", "uuid": "859cd214-2837-4340-95fd-7c029a33238b", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T18:40:32.990Z", "tool_use_result": "Error: Exit code 1\nPaper 2509.13989 not found\n===\n# DMP-TTS: Disentangled multi-modal Prompting for Controllable Text-to-Speech with Chained Guidance\narXiv: 2512.09504\nAuthors: Kang Yin, Chunyu Qiang, Sirui Zhao, Xiaopeng Wang, Yuzhe Liang, Pengfei Cai, Tong Xu, Chen Zhang, Enhong Chen\nYear: 2025 | Venue: \nTopic: tts_vc\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. We propose DMP-TTS, a DiT-based TTS framework that supports multi-modal prompting and achieves explicit style–timbre disentanglement.\n  2. We build Style-CLAP, a cross-modal encoder that learns a shared, discriminative space for style attributes by aligning audio and descriptive text via contrastive learning and multi-task supervision.\n  3. We introduce cCFG, a chained classifier-free guidance scheme that enables independent, continuous control of content, timbre, and style, and adopt representation alignment (REPA) to stabilize and accelerate training.\n\nTags: TTS, TTS/架构-NAR-Diffusion, TTS/功能-DiT, TTS/控制-风格标签, TTS/控制-NL描述, TTS/控制-参考语音\n===\nPaper 2601.12480 not found"}
